text:
@tn_onyoutube8436 let me slow down for you:
global index tracking "everything" -> if there is another 2008, index goes down for years, most likely at the same time I'll be fired. Not a great prospect.
if you insist on investing, build the contrarian pies as explained earlier. The global index is great; in the market we have been over the last few years. But if we'll have a downturn, your ETF will be dragging your portfolio down.
